    <h1>For licensed medical professionals. <em>One month free as a thank-you.</em></h1>
    <p>If you are a licensed physician, nurse, dentist, allied-health practitioner, or mental-health clinician who is building a private practice or a side practice, your second month with me is free. The first month at the standard $175 kicks off the build; the second month is on the house. The work you do is hard and the licensing burden behind it is real.</p>
